  "description": "New full straight graph y=2x-5, including x=-3..6 and corresponding values -11..7. Each source increment of1 in x increases y by2. The plotted extent must contain all four queried unit intervals. New numerical frame with no formula or point-value callouts.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "New full straight graph y=2x-5, including x=-3..6 and corresponding values -11..7. Each source increment of1 in x increases y by2. The plotted extent must contain all four queried unit intervals. New numerical frame with no formula or point-value callouts. This is newly authored mathematics, not a recovered original. Figure 77 was visually inspected only for general axes styling and is not provenance. Numeric scales, plotting windows and panel layout are deliberate authored additions. No formula is printed on the graph.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "exercise": "310",
        "text": "作式 $y=2x-5$ 给出的线性函数的图象。利用图象了解$y$ 值的变化情况：\na) $x$ 值由 $-3$ 增大到 $-2$；\nb) $x$ 值由 $1$ 增大到 $2$；\nc) $x$ 值由 $3$ 增大到 $4$；\nd) $x$ 值由 $5$ 增大到 $6$。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "一般地，式 $y=kx+l$ 给出的函数的图象是直线。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "我们知道，作一条直线只要确定直线上两个点的位置就行了。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "如果线性函数的定义域不包括所有的数，那么它的图象是直线上点的子集（例如，射线、线段、离散点的集合）。"
      }
    ],
